{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8af0fe35-e79e-88ff-ae63-09ff3e9a0340",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T12:40:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Kevin. Anthony DeLuca. I'm calling about a streetlight pole that's leaning. Somebody hit it with a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Okay, leaning how bad? Like, is it over the road or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tilted toward the sidewalk, maybe fifteen, twenty degrees. I looked at it this morning and I said to myself, that's not right. Then my neighbor comes out and she said, that's been like that since Sunday night. And I said, well, did anybody call? And she said no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so nobody's reported it yet. Okay, I'm writing that down, pole struck by a vehicle, leaning toward the sidewalk. Where is it exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 167 Admiral Kalbfus Road. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One sixty-seven Admiral Kalbfus. Got it. Is the light still working, or is it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on. It was flickering last night, though. I'm on the phone with you on my lunch, so I can't stand out there and watch it, but it's definitely flickering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, flickering, that's helpful. Any wires hanging down or anything sparking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no wires down that I can see. It just looks like it's gonna go if the wind gets it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'd like a crew to come check the pole. That's all I'm asking. I got enough going on, I'm trying to figure out refinancing my car loan, and now I got a pole falling over outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I'll put in the request for a crew to go look at it and make it safe. Want me to put a callback number on it, in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six. Perfect. They'll probably get out there in the next couple of days, depending on what else is on their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Couple days. Fine. Just tell them it's leaning toward the sidewalk, people walk there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do, I'll put that in the notes. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
